# cmake options of ROOT V6.40.04_3.14.9, read by recipes/ROOT/build.sh (one per line; '#' starts a comment).
# The install prefix and Python3_EXECUTABLE are added by build.sh.
#
# Same features as V6.32.20_3.11.14 (root-config --features), with these changes:
#   - mathmore and fftw3 added (gsl-devel and fftw-devel are already in packages/root.yml)
#   - davix dropped: 6.40 has no builtin davix any more, and the system has no davix
#   - mysql dropped: removed from ROOT in 6.40
#   - curl added: the new HTTP(S) I/O of 6.40 (replaces davix); needs libcurl-devel
# Also removed or deprecated in 6.40, so not given: builtin_afterimage (libAfterImage is always built in),
# cxx17 (CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD instead), rpath (relative RPATHs are always set).
# fail-on-missing makes cmake stop instead of silently leaving a feature out. 6.40 does not fall back to a
# builtin by itself, so everything that is not on the system is asked for as builtin_*.

-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
-DCMAKE_CXX_STANDARD=17
-Dfail-on-missing=ON
-Dgnuinstall=OFF
-Druntime_cxxmodules=ON
-Dthisroot_scripts=ON

# features
-Dpyroot=ON
-Dtmva=ON
-Dtmva-cpu=ON
-Dtmva-pymva=ON
-Droofit=ON
-Ddataframe=ON
-Dimt=ON
-Dclad=ON
-Dhttp=ON
-Dwebgui=ON
-Droot7=ON
-Dspectrum=ON
-Dgdml=ON
-Dxml=ON
-Dssl=ON
-Dsqlite=ON
-Dfitsio=ON
-Dopengl=ON
-Dx11=ON
-Dasimage=ON
-Dasimage_tiff=ON
-Dvdt=ON
-Dxrootd=ON
-Dmathmore=ON
-Dfftw3=ON
-Dcurl=ON
-Ddavix=OFF

# builtins (not on the system)
-Dbuiltin_gl2ps=ON
-Dbuiltin_lz4=ON
-Dbuiltin_xxhash=ON
-Dbuiltin_nlohmannjson=ON
-Dbuiltin_openui5=ON
-Dbuiltin_tbb=ON
-Dbuiltin_vdt=ON
-Dbuiltin_xrootd=ON
-Dbuiltin_gif=ON
